% holding-blocked: The original is fully notated and its listening reference is verified, but it has not been played by a class. A blues educator must review the history, the form and the framing of call-and-response soloing; a Grade 7 music teacher must trial the answer windows at the starting tempo; a second score reader must check the bar-by-bar audit.
